### Retail cart API: run requests one at a time from the IDE (IntelliJ HTTP Client).
### Start the stack first: docker compose up -d --build
### The first request saves the new cartId; the others reuse it.
### For an automated run with assertions, use scripts/smoke.sh instead.

@cart = http://localhost:8081/api/v1/carts

### 1. First add creates the cart (201 + Location). Same key again = replay, not a second cart.
POST {{cart}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{ "itemId": "54276335", "quantity": 2 }

> {% client.global.set("cartId", response.body.cartId); %}

### 2. Add the same item: quantities merge (2 + 1 = 3)
POST {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": "54276335", "quantity": 1 }

### 3. Add a second item
POST {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": "15744221", "quantity": 1 }

### 4. View the cart: live prices, availability and per-line status
GET {{cart}}/{{cartId}}

### 5. Set an absolute quantity
PATCH {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items/54276335
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 5 }

### 6. Over the purchase limit: 409 QUANTITY_LIMIT_EXCEEDED with maxAllowed
PATCH {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items/54276335
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 25 }

### 7. Item not in the catalog: 422 ITEM_NOT_FOUND
POST {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": "99999999", "quantity": 1 }

### 8. Invalid input: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED, one entry per field
POST {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": "abc", "quantity": 0 }

### 9. Remove an item: 204
DELETE {{cart}}/{{cartId}}/items/15744221

### 10. Unknown cart: 404 CART_NOT_FOUND
GET {{cart}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Target product services, for finding item ids
GET http://localhost:8080/product/v1/items?page=0&size=10
